Subject: [PATCH] opkg: prepare the complete upgrade batch before candidate selection

Keep retained consumers and held packages as constraints, while allowing
explicitly requested consumers and providers to move together. Route normal
whole-system and multi-package upgrades through the same preparation path.
Save states before marking participants and deduplicate repeated requests.

This does not disable signature checks or force dependency resolution.

